In order for Joey to win, he must force
Marek to reveal his traps right away.

55
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:40,485
Once Joey knows what Marek's cards are,
he can devise a strategy to destroy them.

56
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,880
