should I use against you first?

64
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,280
Let's see.

65
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:19,980
I've drawn my Egyptian god card, the
winged dragon of Ra. Joey! Come on!

66
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,557
I don't care what cards you got, Marek.

67
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:25,816
I'm still gonna mop the floor
with that head of yours.

68
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,157
Goodbye, scapegoat.

69
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,070
Hello, panda.

70
00:04:32,900 --> 00:04:35,220
How do you like that? Awesome!

71
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,140
Wait, hold on, you guys.

72
00:04:37,780 --> 00:04:39,192
