card, Coffin Cellar! What?

74
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:49,777
Now each time one of your
monsters is sent to the graveyard,

75
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:53,460
300 life points are
deducted from your total.

76
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,400
No way!

77
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:58,800
Yes, and there's more.

78
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,180
Much more.

79
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,900
Remember Help-O-Emma?

80
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:04,720
It's that monster he put in my graveyard.

81
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:08,820
It just took my insect queen.

82
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,097
That was the best card in my hand.

83
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:13,300
Now I lose 300 life points.

84
00:05:14,740 --> 00:05:16,280
It's over for you.

85
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:20,157
I've devised a foolproof
system of depleting your life

86
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:23,820
points each turn without
having to do anything at all.

87
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,440
I'm afraid he's right.

88
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:32,080
Joey loses one card each turn, and if that
card's a monster, he loses life points.

89
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:33,480
That's not good!

90
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:39,040
And don't forget that my plasma heal is
still attached to your Panther Warrior,

91
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:41,712
