92
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:46,760
My move, at last!

93
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:52,760
First I'll place this card
face down on the field

94
00:05:54,520 --> 00:06:01,197
And then I'll activate this Premature
Burial This allows me to summon

95
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:05,800
