graveyard What are you bringing back?

96
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:10,377
Once I give up 800 life
points I shall revive Drilago

97
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:15,160
from my card graveyard But
there's still more Next,

98
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:17,120
I'll sacrifice Brilago,

99
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,460
