creature known as Legendary Fiend.

102
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:36,940
Wait, he's only got 1500 attack points.

103
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:41,084
You should know that things aren't
always what they appear to be.

104
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:42,730
Huh?

105
00:06:42,813 --> 00:06:45,020
And just what do you mean by that? Marek.

106
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:50,900
My beast gets stronger by
700 attack points each turn.

107
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:54,980
Now make your move, if you dare.

108
00:06:56,040 --> 00:07:00,397
Joey still has way more life points
than Marek does, so I'm not too worried.

109
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,620
Well, that may be the case, Tristan.

110
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:04,785
Life points aren't everything.

111
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:07,557
Marek's totally got the
upper hand in this duel.

112
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:10,816
If only I had my Jinzo, I
could destroy all his traps.

113
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,797
But that card's in my graveyard.

114
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:16,120
If I don't draw something
good now, I'm a goner.

115
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:19,520
Come on. Now!

116
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:22,860
Little Wingard, he's too weak!

117
