remains on the field.

126
00:07:53,980 --> 00:07:57,460
So basically, he's
completely useless to you.

127
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:03,660
I'll pick up where I left off, summoning
little Wingard in defense mode.

128
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:08,849
Then I'll switch my Panther Warrior into
defense mode, so try and get me now.

129
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:13,400
Frame him, Plasma Eel!

130
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:16,760
Weaken his panther and his body!

131
