Marek advances to the final round.

136
00:08:33,500 --> 00:08:36,520
And even worse, I won't
be able to rescue mine.

137
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:39,480
Please be careful up there, Joey,

138
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:43,151
